<title>Sudan's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sudan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sudan-2026-11-02T00:56:13.442Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 00:56:13 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;RSF drone strikes have hit Nyala market, killing 102 civilians and injuring 113, and have set oil facilities ablaze in eastern Sudan while also knocking out power stations in northern Sudan. A senior RSF commander defected and joined the national army, accusing RSF leadership of nepotism. Sudan's cabinet placed the country on maximum alert after RSF drone attacks on power infrastructure, and bakeries in Khartoum have closed due to severe flour and power shortages as the army and RSF wage a silent economic war. Sudan General Al-Atta accused Puntland mercenaries of fighting alongside RSF, and Burhan, Abiy and Afwerki met in Moscow to discuss Russia's interests in the Horn of Africa. 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168703&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxQOGo1SDRqeG5MUXZGOTluOFlURkxhcEtRUjZ4emR4NmNmQW1yajFVaFhRamlzRl9rcTZfZnhzOGVkTEJhQWN0cGdJUjhiQWZSY3JKelhQbDNMenByVktGZFVqWmI5XzJsTzhYZmhBa3RYaS1LZzRmYUdVd2pFLXJNVC14YW5YUjllSlcxNzk2d0s5Y05VbmlGcXNZSWRQM1RrM2diSWdVLXVma21zaFJRLWMzV0p1dG5z0gG-AUFVX3lxTFBFNHduWUhLZXFYSmRHLTFDdm00Z0xEMHdua0EwMmtPemIwSi1ScGhrUjhpcGU4QTBNeXNEaktNek05ZTBZZ1VPMUpheGIxUGZYMmdHT3FXbXhTN245bURaMlE4aDhRNzJxMEVjcUZ5eFQ5WnRvbi02OFFWTnR3UVdkdXNGMFBYS0VMQkhXcmwzX1d2YmZKRVVjOVBUbkFkRnF5Wl9qbC1lR3MybDZ3MkVxRGJDVzBuVEI0Z1FHd0E?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUEFVX3lxTE04TU9Rb052cTh6YzRXVzFhbXZTU21TaUFEdV90eTh6anhFR3FEWXI0XzYwV0VSZXI1MGFydF9Tb0w4eEhfa0R0alB2cElTOVJE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sudan Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.googl